nt council president, Koshitan wants it to go smoothly, but various incidents occur. Will the student council be able to see through to the end of the sports festival?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-09-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/62NkdFrptd0G7wLhbDIrDEIzf9Y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/62NkdFrptd0G7wLhbDIrDEIzf9Y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/248866/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"5471124","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At the clubhouse, Koshitan finds Nokotan in tears and acting strangely...she's concerned at first, but it turns out to be hay fever. Now, Nokotan's trying to think of ways to cope!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-09-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x4XJ30Mto6R7VbutY8JEFn3CXqb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x4XJ30Mto6R7VbutY8JEFn3CXqb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/248866/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"5471125","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hinominami High School is peaceful as usual. However, Nokotan senses the \"hunter's aura\" of Kumatori, a legendary hunter from Hokkaido. Nokotan will take whatever measures necessary to avoid being caught, but what fate awaits her?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-09-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ngM0pjfCRfSijF7VTASTcyrSvgg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ngM0pjfCRfSijF7VTASTcyrSvgg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/248866/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"5471126","seasonNumber